@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Refactor ISA — trajectory_composition_decode_batch
start
:Entry after whole-program validation;

:Set logical ordinal = 1;
while (More carriers?) is (yes)
 :Copy carrier from strided input;
 :laplace_trajectory_composition_decode_one(carrier, logical ordinal);
 if (Decode status not OK?) then (yes)
  :Return EXECUTION_FAILED;
  stop
 endif
 :Copy occurrence to strided output;
 :Advance logical ordinal by occurrence.run_length;
endwhile (no)
:Set output.count = input.count;
:Return ISA_OK;
stop
legend
Execute-wrapper source trace.
Validation and native semantic callees are separate boundaries.
No runtime acceptance asserted.
endlegend
@enduml
